                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Why Designers Love Our Invoice Generator</h2>
                <p class="text-muted mb-3">
                    As a designer, your time is best spent creating, not wrestling with accounting software. RatPDF helps graphic designers, web designers, UI/UX pros, and creative freelancers generate professional, branded invoices in seconds – for any project size.
                </p>

                <p class="text-muted mb-3">
                    Our tool is completely free, requires no registration, and produces clean, client-friendly PDF invoices that include all the details your clients expect: project scope, deliverables, hourly or fixed pricing, deposits paid, balance due, and payment instructions.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ No monthly fees – 100% free</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Designer-specific invoice fields</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Milestone and deposit tracking</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Add your logo and creative brand</li>
